    "title": "Budget-three antipodal pure harmonic binary-quartic norm gate",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For a split squarefree deleted quartic in characteristic different from two and three, the product of the classical cubic binary-quartic invariant over the eight square-root sign classes is a symmetric degree-24 support polynomial. It vanishes exactly when some lift is harmonic and is evaluated compactly by three quadratic norms.",
